{"id":"y7-flowcharts-l5","label":"7CT.01 L5: Flowcharts Recap","steps":[{"id":"do-now","label":"Do Now: Reading a Flowchart","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-do-now","validatorKey":"y7l5_do_now","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Do Now: Reading a Flowchart</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A recap of Lesson 1. Read the flowchart from Start to End.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 184 316\" width=\"184\" height=\"316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Move 30 steps; Say &quot;Ready&quot;; Move 20 steps; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc1a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 48 L92 78\" marker-end=\"url(#fc1a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 114 L92 142\" marker-end=\"url(#fc1a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 178 L92 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc1a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 242 L92 272\" marker-end=\"url(#fc1a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"100.5\">Move 30 steps</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,142 172,142 158,178 12,178\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"164.5\">Say &quot;Ready&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"206\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"228.5\">Move 20 steps</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"272\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"292.5\">End</text></svg></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-do-now-a\">(a) How many steps does the sprite move altogether? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-a\" aria-label=\"Do Now: Reading a Flowchart part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-do-now-b\">(b) What does the sprite say? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-b\" aria-label=\"Do Now: Reading a Flowchart part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-do-now-c\">(c) Name the symbol used for Say \"Ready\". [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-c\" aria-label=\"Do Now: Reading a Flowchart part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y7l5-do-now-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y7l5-do-now-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"do-now-2","label":"Do Now: Truth Tables","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-do-now-2","validatorKey":"y7l5_do_now_2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Do Now: Truth Tables</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A recap of Lesson 3. Fill in every output box with 1 or 0.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start\"><div><p class=\"lesson-lead\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><strong>AND</strong></p><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>A AND B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-a\" aria-label=\"AND row a\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-b\" aria-label=\"AND row b\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-c\" aria-label=\"AND row c\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-d\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-d\" aria-label=\"AND row d\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"lesson-lead\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><strong>OR</strong></p><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>A OR B</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-e\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-e\" aria-label=\"OR row e\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-f\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-f\" aria-label=\"OR row f\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-g\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-g\" aria-label=\"OR row g\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-h\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-h\" aria-label=\"OR row h\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"lesson-lead\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><strong>NOT</strong></p><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>A</th><th>NOT A</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-i\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-i\" aria-label=\"NOT row i\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td><input id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-j\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-j\" aria-label=\"NOT row j\" autocomplete=\"off\" style=\"width:3.2em;text-align:center\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 10 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y7l5-do-now-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"},{"id":"title","label":"Flowcharts Recap","content":"<div class=\"lesson-title-slide\"><p class=\"lesson-title-kicker\">Computational Thinking</p><h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Flowcharts Recap</h2><p>Year 7, 7CT.01 L5</p></div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Today:</strong> everything from Lessons 1 to 4, ready for the test next lesson.</li><li><strong>For each lesson:</strong> a reminder, a check, then a drill to practise it.</li><li><strong>Plenary:</strong> one drill that mixes every kind of question, with new values each time.</li></ul>"},{"id":"recap-1","label":"Recap: Reading and Correcting Flowcharts","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Recap: Reading and Correcting Flowcharts</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Every shape has one job. Follow the arrows from Start to End.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 388 316\" width=\"388\" height=\"316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Move 50 steps; Space pressed? (True to Say &quot;Jump&quot;, False to Say &quot;Wait&quot;); Say &quot;Jump&quot;; End; Say &quot;Wait&quot;\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc2a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 48 L100 78\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 114 L100 131\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 189 L100 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"110\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\">True</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M188 160 L296 160 L296 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"196\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\">False</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M100 242 L100 272\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M296 242 L296 288 L152 288\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"48\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"20\" y=\"78\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"100.5\">Move 50 steps</text><polygon class=\"fc-d\" points=\"100,131 188,160 100,189 12,160\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"100\" y=\"164.5\">Space pressed?</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"34,206 180,206 166,242 20,242\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"228.5\">Say &quot;Jump&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"48\" y=\"272\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"100\" y=\"292.5\">End</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"230,206 376,206 362,242 216,242\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"296\" y=\"228.5\">Say &quot;Wait&quot;</text></svg></div></div><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Rounded:</strong> Start and End.</li><li><strong>Rectangle (process):</strong> an instruction, such as Move, Turn or Point in direction.</li><li><strong>Sloping (input or output):</strong> information in or out, such as Say.</li><li><strong>Diamond (decision):</strong> a question with a True path and a False path.</li><li><strong>To correct a flowchart:</strong> compare every box with the requirement, fix the wrong one, then test again.</li></ul></div></div>"},{"id":"check-1","label":"Check: Find the Error","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-check-1","validatorKey":"y7l5_check_1","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Find the Error</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">This flowchart should make the sprite face left, move 40 steps, then say \"Done\".</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 184 316\" width=\"184\" height=\"316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Point in direction 90; Move 40 steps; Say &quot;Done&quot;; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc3a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 48 L92 78\" marker-end=\"url(#fc3a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 114 L92 142\" marker-end=\"url(#fc3a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 178 L92 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc3a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 242 L92 272\" marker-end=\"url(#fc3a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"42\" cy=\"18\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"42\" y=\"22.5\">1</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"92\" y=\"93.5\">Point in direction</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"92\" y=\"107.5\">90</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"14\" cy=\"80\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"14\" y=\"84.5\">2</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"142\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"164.5\">Move 40 steps</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"14\" cy=\"144\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"14\" y=\"148.5\">3</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,206 172,206 158,242 12,242\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"228.5\">Say &quot;Done&quot;</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"14\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"14\" y=\"212.5\">4</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"272\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"292.5\">End</text><circle class=\"fc-n\" cx=\"42\" cy=\"274\" r=\"11\"/><text class=\"fc-nt\" x=\"42\" y=\"278.5\">5</text></svg></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-1-a\">(a) Which box number is wrong? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-1-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-1-a\" aria-label=\"Check: Find the Error part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-1-b\">(b) Write the corrected box. [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-1-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-1-b\" aria-label=\"Check: Find the Error part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y7l5-check-1-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 2 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y7l5-check-1-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"activity-1","label":"Activity 1: Symbols and Sequence","type":"embedded-app","appId":"drill-y7-flowcharts-foundations","embedContainerId":"y7l5-activity-1","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 1: Symbols and Sequence</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Practise naming the symbols and reading flowcharts in order.</p><div id=\"y7l5-activity-1\"></div>"},{"id":"recap-2","label":"Recap: Inputs, Decisions and Loops","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Recap: Inputs, Decisions and Loops</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A key press is an input. A decision checks it, again and again.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 270\" width=\"282\" height=\"270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Right arrow pressed? (True to Point in direction 90, False to Right arrow pressed?); Point in direction 90; Move 10 steps\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc4a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 48 L130 83\" marker-end=\"url(#fc4a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 141 L130 158\" marker-end=\"url(#fc4a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"140\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"start\">True</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 194 L130 222\" marker-end=\"url(#fc4a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M50 240 L30 240 L30 61 L130 61\" marker-end=\"url(#fc4a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M218 112 L264 112 L264 71 L130 71\" marker-end=\"url(#fc4a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"224\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\">False</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"78\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><polygon class=\"fc-d\" points=\"130,83 218,112 130,141 42,112\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"109.5\">Right arrow</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"123.5\">pressed?</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"158\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"173.5\">Point in direction</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"187.5\">90</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"222\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"244.5\">Move 10 steps</text></svg></div></div><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>True:</strong> the key is pressed, so point and move.</li><li><strong>False:</strong> the key is not pressed, so go straight back and check again.</li><li><strong>Both paths go back to the decision:</strong> it keeps checking until Stop is pressed. This is an infinite loop.</li><li><strong>Directions:</strong> right 90, left -90, up 0, down 180.</li></ul></div></div>"},{"id":"check-2","label":"Check: A Keyboard Loop","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-check-2","validatorKey":"y7l5_check_2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: A Keyboard Loop</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Use this flowchart for every part.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 270\" width=\"282\" height=\"270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Left arrow pressed? (True to Point in direction -90, False to Left arrow pressed?); Point in direction -90; Move 5 steps\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc5a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 48 L130 83\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 141 L130 158\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"140\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"start\">True</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 194 L130 222\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M50 240 L30 240 L30 61 L130 61\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M218 112 L264 112 L264 71 L130 71\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"224\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\">False</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"78\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><polygon class=\"fc-d\" points=\"130,83 218,112 130,141 42,112\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"109.5\">Left arrow</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"123.5\">pressed?</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"158\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"173.5\">Point in direction</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"187.5\">-90</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"222\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"244.5\">Move 5 steps</text></svg></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-2-a\">(a) The left arrow is checked 4 times: pressed, pressed, not pressed, pressed. How many steps does the sprite move? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-2-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-2-a\" aria-label=\"Check: A Keyboard Loop part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-2-b\">(b) The left arrow is not pressed. Which box comes next? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-2-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-2-b\" aria-label=\"Check: A Keyboard Loop part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-2-c\">(c) What number makes the sprite face down? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-2-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-2-c\" aria-label=\"Check: A Keyboard Loop part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y7l5-check-2-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y7l5-check-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"recap-3","label":"Recap: AND, OR, NOT and Comparisons","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Recap: AND, OR, NOT and Comparisons</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">1 means True and 0 means False.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center\"><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>Up</th><th>Right</th><th>Up AND Right</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>Up</th><th>Right</th><th>Up OR Right</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>AND</strong> is 1 only when both parts are 1.</li><li><strong>OR</strong> is 1 when at least one part is 1.</li><li><strong>NOT</strong> swaps the value: NOT 1 is 0, NOT 0 is 1.</li><li><strong>Comparisons:</strong> &gt; bigger than, &lt; smaller than, = the same, &lt;&gt; not the same. Each gives 1 or 0.</li></ul></div></div>"},{"id":"check-3","label":"Check: Logic and Comparisons","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-check-3","validatorKey":"y7l5_check_3","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Logic and Comparisons</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Space is 0 and Enter is 1. Score is 12 and Target is 20.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-3-a\">(a) What is Space OR Enter: 1 or 0? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-3-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-3-a\" aria-label=\"Check: Logic and Comparisons part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-3-b\">(b) What is NOT Space: 1 or 0? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-3-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-3-b\" aria-label=\"Check: Logic and Comparisons part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y7l5-check-3-c\">(c) What is Score > Target: 1 or 0? [1]</label><input id=\"y7l5-check-3-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-3-c\" aria-label=\"Check: Logic and Comparisons part c\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y7l5-check-3-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y7l5-check-3-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"},{"id":"activity-2","label":"Activity 2: Decisions, Loops and Logic","type":"embedded-app","appId":"drill-y7-flowcharts-control","embedContainerId":"y7l5-activity-2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 2: Decisions, Loops and Logic</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Inputs, movement, infinite loops, AND, OR, NOT and comparisons.</p><div id=\"y7l5-activity-2\"></div>"},{"id":"recap-4","label":"Recap: Sub-routines","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Recap: Sub-routines</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A sub-routine is a named part of an algorithm, written once as its own flowchart.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 334\" width=\"384\" height=\"334\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; CALL DrawSide; Turn right 90 degrees; CALL DrawSide; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc6a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><text class=\"fc-title\" x=\"6\" y=\"30\">Main</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 66 L92 96\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 132 L92 160\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 196 L92 224\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 260 L92 290\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"34\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"54.5\">Start</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"96\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><path class=\"fc-line\" d=\"M22 96V132M162 96V132\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"118.5\">CALL DrawSide</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"160\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"92\" y=\"175.5\">Turn right 90</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"92\" y=\"189.5\">degrees</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><path class=\"fc-line\" d=\"M22 224V260M162 224V260\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"246.5\">CALL DrawSide</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"290\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"310.5\">End</text><text class=\"fc-title\" x=\"206\" y=\"30\">Sub-routine: DrawSide</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M292 66 L292 96\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M292 132 L292 160\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M292 196 L292 226\" marker-end=\"url(#fc6a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"240\" y=\"34\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"292\" y=\"54.5\">Start</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"212\" y=\"96\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"292\" y=\"118.5\">Move 50 steps</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"212\" y=\"160\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"292\" y=\"175.5\">Turn right 90</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"292\" y=\"189.5\">degrees</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"240\" y=\"226\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"292\" y=\"246.5\">End</text></svg></div></div><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>CALL</strong> jumps to the sub-routine and runs it from its own Start.</li><li><strong>At its End,</strong> Main carries on from just after the CALL.</li><li><strong>Written once, used many times:</strong> each CALL runs the same flowchart again.</li></ul></div></div>"},{"id":"check-4","label":"Check: Following CALL","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y7l5-check-4","validatorKey":"y7l5_check_4","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Following CALL</h2><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:420px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 398\" width=\"384\" height=\"398\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Say &quot;Hi&quot;; CALL Beep; CALL Beep; Say &quot;Bye&quot;; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc7a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><text class=\"fc-title\" x=\"6\" y=\"30\">Main</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 66 L92 96\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 132 L92 160\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 196 L92 224\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 260 L92 288\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 324 L92 354\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"34\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"54.5\">Start</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,96 172,96 158,132 12,132\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"118.5\">Say &quot;Hi&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"160\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><path class=\"fc-line\" d=\"M22 160V196M162 160V196\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"182.5\">CALL Beep</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><path class=\"fc-line\" d=\"M22 224V260M162 224V260\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"246.5\">CALL Beep</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,288 172,288 158,324 12,324\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"310.5\">Say &quot;Bye&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"354\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"374.5\">End</text><text class=\"fc-title\" x=\"206\" y=\"30\">Sub-routine: Beep</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M292 66 L292 96\" marker-end=\"url(#fc7a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M292 132 L292